<section id="1001C_S000C" variety="S000C">
<name>Audio &amp; Visual</name>
<ttl id="1001C_S000C_742AE_T002P" variety="T002P">
<name>Speaker Assembly Front NO.2</name>
<para id="RM000002BZP001X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="641JW-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000002BZP001X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000002BZP001X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000018N00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Speaker Assembly Front NO.2</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the speaker installation is not loose or rattling.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that there is no foreign matter inside the speaker and that the speaker cone paper is not torn.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Measurement (RH)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141932J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the speaker assembly front NO.2 connector.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<table>
<title>Resistance:</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4(+) - 3(TWR+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2(-) - 1(TWR-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Measurement (LH)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141932J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the speaker assembly front NO.2 connector.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<table>
<title>Resistance:</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.39in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4(+) - 3(TWL+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2(-) - 1(TWL-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Swap Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Swap with a normal speaker assembly front NO.2 and operate again.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Return to Normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If a malfunction of either the left or right speaker assembly front NO.2 is suspected, swap the left and right speakers and inspect.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
